<b>the damage to the ecology and the damage to the climate caused by agriculture will be over. </b>

134
00:12:36,875 --> 00:12:42,083
<b>We're hopeful that the other sectors are thinking about their own healing and repair as well.</b>

135
00:12:48,833 --> 00:12:52,250
<b>At first glance, what Burhan describes is a method. </b>

136
00:12:52,958 --> 00:12:56,416
